		"title": "n8n Node Contract: the provider interface",
		"version": "2.5.0",
		"description": "Generated from spec/wit (world provider-bundle) by scripts/spec.ts. Do not edit.\n\nA provider: it supplies one capability (a chat model, a memory, a tool or embeddings) to a\nroot node.\n\nBoth sides send requests on one connection. `x-direction` tells which side answers a method. A method without `result` is a notification. Names in brackets are not WIT functions: the JSON-RPC mapping adds them."
	},
